 or the agent deleting the file?\n- Is the agent creating and deleting the file in the same set of requests? (so after pressing keep going twice) \n\nAnyway:\n- Try to either decrease or increasing chat.agent.maxRequests until like 100/125(try incrementing with 10-25 requests) \n- The file being in \"x file changed\"(if agent deletes it) after deletion should only indicates a diff in deletion/removal of the file. \n- Use prompts/ instruct the agent to not delete (certain files) but create backup files of them up instead, this way agent will create backup files instead of removing them\n\nShould either solve the issue or give more insight in what is being used as actual context. \n ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2972264069/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2972277301","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12356#issuecomment-2972277301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12356","id":2972277301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6xKVo1","user":{"login":"sascharo","id":88222654,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MjIyNjU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88222654?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sascharo","html_url":"https://github.com/sascharo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sascharo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sascharo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sascharo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sascharo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sascharo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saschar